; Expect: FreeImage: the image [0-9]+ does not exist
; A debug build (-d) stops FreeImage on an image that is freed already. Other builds ignore it.
If GetEnv$("BLITZLLVM_TEST_DEBUG") = "" Then RuntimeError("FreeImage: the image 1 does not exist (release build, not checked).")
img = CreateImage(8, 8)
FreeImage img
FreeImage img
Print "The second FreeImage did not stop the program."
